        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dream Abyss: Survivors&quot; is an indie game that combines the thrill of <strong>action roguelike</strong>, <strong>bullet hell shooting</strong>, and <strong>hack-and-slash RPG</strong> gameplay.<br>Enter an anime-style <strong>dreamlike fantasy world</strong>, battle against nightmares, and experience a new survival adventure every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of the brave <strong>female protagonist Lily</strong>, who dives into the abyss to rescue her younger sister Lumi, trapped deep within nightmares.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌀 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique playable heroines</strong><br>Each with distinct combat styles, exclusive skills, and beautifully crafted 3D models.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/3cd5065c1dfd6aeed69cfb8d8284ffe8.poster.avif?t=1764476020\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/3cd5065c1dfd6aeed69cfb8d8284ffe8.webm?t=1764476020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/3cd5065c1dfd6aeed69cfb8d8284ffe8.mp4?t=1764476020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>                     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/d364b0e45f0aeda005493f9318394f0b.poster.avif?t=1764476020\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636470/extras/d364b0e45f0aeda005493f9318394f0b.webm?t=1764476020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite